                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Third Report of the Economic Subcommittee to the
                        Foreign Ministers</hi><anchor n="6" xml:id="d891-f2"/></head>
                <p>The Economic Subcommittee considered the questions of a statement regarding
                    German external assets<anchor n="7" xml:id="d891-f3"/> and an Article 19<anchor
                        n="8" xml:id="d891-f4"/> of the Economic Principles relating to payment for
                    imports into Germany.</p>
                <p>The Subcommittee also failed to reach agreement in the matter of an Article 19 of
                    the Economic Principles.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
